    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Daūdi kūja Nobu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 21:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Daūdi ūja Nobu kūlī ngabīji Ahimeleki; ū Ahimeleki aho wamona ū Daūdi ūdetema; ūmūūja, “Ni kinehe ūlī iyene ūtī na ūngī ose ose hamò nang'ho?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.21.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.21.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 21:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Daūdi ūnshokeja ū ngabīji Ahimeleki, “Ū ntemi wanitūmaga mhayo nebe, ūniwīla gīkī, ‘Atizūdeeba munhū ūngī ose ose īyo ūlīyīta, nū nīmo ūyo ūtūmilwe.’ A banhū bane a bene nabawīlaga tūkūmaanhīja halebe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.21.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.21.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 21:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alilūūlū ī gīsī, ūlī na kīnhū kī a henaha? Ninhage migatī ītanò, nūūlū shose shose īsho ūlī nasho aha.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.21.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.21.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 21:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ū ngabīji ūnshokeja ū Daūdi ūhaya, “Natī na migatī īyo īdūgije kūliiwa na banhū bose bose, alīyo īlīho migatī myeela a henaha, ūlū batīnaabiza na būsangī na bakīma dūhū a basūmba.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.21.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.21.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 21:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daūdi nang'hwe ūshosha, “A bakīma a bene tūtīniikuumya nabo, gīt'ūmo nakīītīlaga na kale dūhū ūlū tūlī mu shikū ja būlūgū; nguno nūūlū tūlī mu milīmo ya shikū jose ī mibīlī ya basūmba īkabizaga myeela no, sumbagwa na lelo īyī!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.21.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.21.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 21:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū ngabīji ūng'winha ī migatī ī myeela, nguno yalī ītīho migatī yīngī a henaho, ūlū ītī ī migatī dūhū ī ya kūtūūlwa kū būtongi bo ng'wa SEEBA, īyo īkasangwa yakaabanyiagwa ū lūshikū lwenūlo, yūūtūūlwa ho misebu yīnjiwa īyo yalīho ī kwandya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.21.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.21.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 21:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū lūshikū lwenūlo walīho hoi na ūmò wa batūmami ba ng'wa Saulo, lina lyakwe walī Doegi muna Edomu; ūmò wa badīīmi ba ng'wa Saulo, walī wahūba wenhwa kūlang'hanwa kū būtongi bo ng'wa SEEBA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.21.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.21.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 21:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Daūdi ūng'wīla hangī ū Ahimeleki, “Ūtī na'ichimu nūūlū lūshū a henaha? Ū nene natizile nalo ū lūshū lwane, nūūlū shilanga shose shose nguno ū nīmo gwa ntemi gwalī gwabiza gwa wangū wangū no.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.21.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.21.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 21:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū ngabīji ūshosha alīhaya, “Līlīho dūhū ī līlūshū lya ng'wa Goliati ū Mfilisiti ūyo ūkamūlagīla kū longa lwa Ela; līlī kū numa ya ifoodi līlingīīlilwe mu ng'wenda. Ūlū ūlīīlītogwa līsolage, nguno lūtīho lūshū lūngī a henaha ūlū lītī lyenīlo dūhū.” Ū Daūdi ūhaya, “Angū nīyo lītīho līngī ī lyawiza gītī lyenīlo; lyenhage ūninhe.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.21.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.21.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Daūdi kūpeelela Gaasi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 21:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.21.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.21.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 21:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū lūshikū lwenūlo ū Daūdi ūmpeela ū Saulo, ūja kūlī Akishi ntemi wa Gaasi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.21.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.21.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 21:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo a batūmami ba ng'wa Akishi būng'wīla, “Baba ntemi, ū ng'wenūyū atī ng'wene ū ntemi wayo ī sī yenīyo? Atī ng'wene ūyo bakīmbaga na mu mbina jabo balīhaya gīkī,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.21.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.21.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 21:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.21.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.21.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 21:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī mihayo yenīyo yūng'wingīla gete ū Daūdi ū mu ng'holò yakwe, ūng'ogoha no ū ntemi Akishi wa Gaasi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.21.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.21.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 21:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūgalūcha ī nhūngwa ja kiikalīle kaakwe ū kū būtongi wabo; aho alī mu makono gabo wandya kwīta mihayo ya koolecha ū kūbo gīkī walī ageehelilwe, wiyītya kūbiza gītī nsaji. Ūyūdatagūla bo njala a ha milyango ya ha mita, kūnū akūsejaga lūsoona sagala sagala, kūshisha kūjilobya ī ndezu jakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.21.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.21.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 21:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū ntemi Akishi ūbawīla a batūmami bakwe, “Mulīmona ū munhū ng'wenūyo, angū nsaji gete! Hama mulīnenhela wakī ū nene ū ng'wenūyo? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.21.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.21.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 21:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A bing'we ng'wanibonaga gīkī naageehelilwe a basaji ū mu sī yane, nose mulīnenhela na munhū alī gīkī wikale akoolechaga lūsalo lwakwe kū būtongi wane? Ū ng'wenūyū ingīle gete mu ng'wane ūmo alī ng'wenūmū?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.21.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.21.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
